<title>FRANCE: G Des Eaux sees 96 net at 1.8 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>G Des Eaux sees 96 net at 1.8 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale Des Eaux will post 1996 net profit of about 1.8 billion francs after a net loss the year before of 3.69 billion francs, company chairman Jean-Marie Messier said on Monday.</p>
<p>Messier said the results would be &quot;strongly marked by exceptional items, notably capital gains from asset sales&quot;.</p>
<p>He said the company's operating profit would be close to the 3.7 billion franc profit recorded in 1994.</p>
<p>Turnover in 1996 should be up three percent to 164 billion francs he added.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
